For every \(s\in\mathbb R^n\),
\[
\max\left\{\langle s,x\rangle:x\in\mathbb R^n,\ \sum_{i=1}^n(x^{(i)})^2\le 1\right\}
=\left(\sum_{i=1}^n(s^{(i)})^2\right)^{1/2}
=\|s\|_2.
\]

